      "per_unit_reason": "Read all literal formulas, quantifiers, proof-route and scope sentences. Exact actual tanh derivative, restricted sharp IsGreatest/IsLeast extrema, true zero extension, actual FTC and source roundings cover the mathematical requests/answers. The source now explicitly assumes positive radius. Theorem1 attribution is checked against the supplied primary text, with centred-zero/local-box scope retained.",
